sequenceDiagram
  participant A as $$\alpha$$lex
  participant B as Bob
  A->>B: Hello, does $$\frac{1}{2}+1=2$$?
  loop Every $$\frac{1}{2}$$ minute
    B->>B: Recheck value
  end
  alt $$x > 0$$
    A->>B: Yes
  else $$x \le 0$$
    A->>B: No
  end
  par $$\theta$$ branch
    A->>B: one
  and $$\beta$$ branch
    B->>A: two
  end
